{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-3-1-2-4:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_3_1_2_4\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"block:v2-n-3-1-2-4:p1\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"主要估计目标的伴发事件应按治疗策略（treatment policy）处理。伴发事件应包括鼻塞加重需全身激素或手术干预、因不良事件停药和失访；救援治疗应定义为因鼻塞加重使用全身激素或鼻窦手术。救援治疗应不排除、不删失，并继续按随机分组纳入主要分析；研究应允许稳定背景鼻用激素并记录。第24周缺失主要终点应采用无应答插补（NRI），敏感性分析应采用tipping point分析。具体伴发事件、定义、处理策略及理由见表 1 伴发事件及处理策略。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2-n-3-1-2-4:t1\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"table:v2-n-3-1-2-4:ice-strategy\",\"block_id\":\"block:v2-n-3-1-2-4:t1\",\"title\":\"表 1 伴发事件及处理策略\",\"domain\":\"generic\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"version\":0,\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"source_locator\":\"\",\"word_layout\":{},\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"event\",\"label\":\"伴发事件\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"event\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"column_id\":\"definition\",\"label\":\"定义\",\"order\":2,\"semantic_role\":\"definition\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"column_id\":\"strategy\",\"label\":\"处理策略\",\"order\":3,\"semantic_role\":\"strategy\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"column_id\":\"rationale\",\"label\":\"理由\",\"order\":4,\"semantic_role\":\"rationale\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"row:ice:header\",\"order\":0,\"style_role\":\"header\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"estimand:ice:cell:event\",\"row_id\":\"row:ice:header\",\"column_id\":\"event\",\"text\":\"伴发事件\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"estimand:ice:cell:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:ice:header\",\"column_id\":\"definition\",\"text\":\"定义\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"estimand:ice:cell:strategy\",\"row_id\":\"row:ice:header\",\"column_id\":\"strategy\",\"text\